    {
      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.hosted.seadots.experiment",
      "name": "Computational Experiment",
      "abstract": "OGC API Records profile for describing a computational experiment realising a documented model. Points at the executable code that runs the experiment (any language / format that exists and runs \u2014 Python, Jupyter, R, \u2026), and binds it to the documented model (an ODD record), the evidence equation (an `equation-property-relationship` record), and to standalone input records (one per data class) and `experiment-output` records, all referenced by URI.",
